# {{context|pathology|lang=en}} An acute [[febrile]] [[disease]] of the [[tropic]]s caused by a [[flavivirus]], transmitted by [[mosquito]]es, and characterized by high fever, [[rash]], [[headache]], and severe muscle and joint pain.

